# Terraform / IaC
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins provider versions for
# everyone, which is the same reason buf and the protoc plugins are pinned in tools/go.mod.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Variable files may contain environment-specific or sensitive values, so they are not
# committed. Commit .tfvars.example instead.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

